# "Target creature gains deathtouch and indestructible until end of turn" (CR 702.2b, 702.12b, 611.2a): on turn 3 Bot1 casts Offer Immortality (Black Lotus
# mana) on its Memnite (1/1) and attacks. Bot2's Grizzly Bears blocks: Memnite's 1 deathtouch damage kills the Bears and the 2 damage on Memnite does not
# destroy it. Both keywords are there during the turn and gone in the next.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Memnite
Offer Immortality
Island x17

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Mox Ruby
Grizzly Bears
Island x17

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Memnite.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Grizzly Bears.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
? Bot1.Battlefield.Memnite.Keywords = (absent)
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Black)
Bot1.Hand.Offer Immortality.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Memnite)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Memnite.Keywords = Deathtouch; Indestructible
Bot1.Attack(Memnite > Bot2)
Bot2.Block(Grizzly Bears > Memnite)
[T3 Bot1.Main2]
? Bot1.Battlefield.Memnite.Damage = 2
[T4 Bot2.Main1]

[Expect]
Bot2.Graveyard = Grizzly Bears
Bot1.Battlefield.Memnite.Keywords = (absent)
Bot1.Battlefield.Memnite.Damage = 0
